# Animations

- Prefer `react-native-reanimated` for animations and gestures
- Prefer Reanimated v4 with the New Architecture
- Avoid React Native `Animated` API for new features
- Prefer animations running on the UI thread
- Prefer worklets for performance-sensitive animations
- Prefer transform animations over layout animations when possible
- Keep animations smooth, responsive and lightweight
- Prefer entering and exiting animations for state transitions
- Avoid expensive calculations during animations
- Keep animation logic isolated and reusable
